      "title": "\"Linux IPMB-over-I2C\" is really just \"Linux I2C\".",
      "message": "\"Linux IPMB-over-I2C\" is really just \"Linux I2C\".\n\nLinktype 209 started out as LINKTYPE_IPMB_LINUX, for IPMB-over-I2C, but\nthe header only contained I2C information, and it was also used for HDMI\nDDC-over-I2C, so there's no guarantee that LINKTYPE_IPMB_LINUX contains\nIPMB traffic.  It was renamed LINKTYPE_I2C_LINUX.\n\nMake changes to reflect that.\n",
